       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BENCH-STRING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-COUNTER    PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-SOURCE     PIC X(80) VALUE
           "THE QUICK BROWN FOX JUMPS OVER THE LAZY DOG".
       01 WS-TARGET     PIC X(80).
       01 WS-PART       PIC X(20).
       01 WS-LEN        PIC 9(4).
       01 WS-ITERATIONS PIC 9(9) VALUE 100000.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM WS-ITERATIONS TIMES
               MOVE WS-SOURCE TO WS-TARGET
               MOVE WS-SOURCE(1:20) TO WS-PART
               MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-SOURCE) TO WS-LEN
               STRING WS-SOURCE DELIMITED BY SPACES
                   INTO WS-TARGET
               END-STRING
               ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "STRING BENCHMARK"
           DISPLAY "ITERATIONS: " WS-COUNTER
           DISPLAY "LENGTH: " WS-LEN
           STOP RUN.
